{"id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-compact.md","title":"Compact Space","display":"df-compact — Compact Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-compact","aliases":["58-df-compact","Compact Space","Compactness"],"display":"df-compact — Compact Space","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-compact"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-compact</span><span>Compact Space</span><span>Compactness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compact — Compact Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"219f53fb10f5fa92\" href=\"?note=219f53fb10f5fa92\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md\">../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\tau_{(-)}:V\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"219f53fb10f5fa92\" href=\"?note=219f53fb10f5fa92\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md\">../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\cup V\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\cup V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(\\mathcal U,X,\\tau)\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(\\mathcal V,X,\\tau))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\forall\\mathcal U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(\\mathcal U,X,\\tau)\\to\\exists\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;(\\mathrm{Finite}(\\mathcal V)\\land\\mathrm{OpenCover}_S(\\mathcal V,X,\\tau))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compact}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau_X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compact} \\vdash \\mathrm{Compact}_S(X)\\leftrightarrow X\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\tau_{(-)})\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Compact: every open cover has finite subcover</li>\n<li>Sequentially compact: every sequence has convergent subsequence</li>\n<li>Countably compact: every countable open cover has finite subcover</li>\n<li>Heine-Borel: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,b] \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^n\">\\([a,b] \\subseteq \\mathbb{R}^n\\)</span> is compact</li>\n<li>Tychonoff: product of compact spaces is compact</li>\n<li>Compact implies limit point compact</li>\n<li>The unary form is a compatibility notation for a topological-space object with its designated topology; it does not existentially choose a new topology.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Munkres, Topology, Chapter 4</li>\n<li>Engelking, General Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md","status":"resolved","id":"219f53fb10f5fa92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-open-cover.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0a